  {
    "id": "coffret",
    "title": {
      "fr": "Marc Riboud",
      "en": "Marc Riboud"
    },
    "category": {
      "fr": "Édition & packaging",
      "en": "Editorial & packaging"
    },
    "description": {
      "fr": "Un coffret consacré au travail de Marc Riboud : un livre de 324 pages au format A4, des affiches, des portraits dans des boîtes de pellicule, des porte-clés et un petit livre. La recherche sur son œuvre et sa vie a guidé la conception de cet ensemble.",
      "en": "it's an editorial and packaging design to represent the artist of my choice's work and its connection to my graphic world. i did an extensive research on the artist's work and life, and created a visual identity that reflects the Riboud's work and my own style without touching the original work. the box includes a 324 pages book (A4), posters(A2, A5), film contaiers(portraits),keychains and a tiny book. the poster is a visual representation of the artist's work, and the tiny book is more of a personal touch on his work."
    },
