    },
    "description": {
      "fr": "Une séance photo autour de l’idée d’une image sans date, mêlant des silhouettes des années 1960 aux années 2000 et une approche contemporaine. Réalisée au studio de l’ESAD Amiens avec Linh Khan Thai, puis retouchée dans Lightroom et Photoshop.",
      "en": "fashion photoshoot for the concept of something without a date. the idea was to create a photoshoot with the looks of 60s to 00s with a modern twist. the photoshoot was taken in the studio of esad amiens and the model is Linh khan thai also from the school. the photoshoot was taken with a digital camera and edited in lightroom and photoshop."
